    "summary": "A pair of woven wool belts.  Warp faced tabby woven cloth with a wide red stripe framed by blue and red broken stripes.  Stitched on each side at one end is a rectangular piece of red wool woven cloth with a red/white and blue plaited cord attached, finished with a red wool tassel.  The other end has a piece of leather stitched to each side, extending into a plied cord with a knot at the end.",
